Package: clariostarparser
Title: Parse BMG CLARIOstar Plate Reader Excel Exports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jack", "Pepper", email = "jack.pepper@thekids.org.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Parses Excel exports from BMG CLARIOstar plate readers into tidy
    long-format data frames. Supports both the "Table All Data points" export
    (already tidy, one row per well) and the "Microplate End point" export
    (stacked per-measure plate matrices), returning either or both alongside
    parsed run metadata (User, Test ID, Test Name, Date, Time, sample ID).
    Part of the jackspepper/tools collection.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    readxl,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    stringr,
    rlang
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    writexl
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/jackspepper/tools
BugReports: https://github.com/jackspepper/tools/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
